Bugfix: Name the support key field and the log level selector

The support key input in the enterprise support key panel and the log level
selector in the log panel had no accessible name. In both cases the visible
caption existed but was only a bare text node next to the control, so it never
became a programmatic label. Screen readers announced an unnamed text box and
an unnamed combo box, voice control could not address either element, and
clicking the caption did not focus the control.

Both captions are now wrapped in a label element that references the existing
id. No new translation string is required and the rendered layout is unchanged.

WCAG 2.1 AA, SC 3.3.2, SC 4.1.2, SC 1.3.1
